WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.647
Namaste! YourKhata ek platform hai, jahan
business apna saara hisaab — bills, stock,
payments aur collections — ek hi jagah
rakhta hai.

00:00:11.097 --> 00:00:18.286
Is guide mein hum step by step Shop &
billing module dekhenge, jo aaj live hai —
computer par.

00:00:18.736 --> 00:00:27.167
Hamari demo dukaan hai Sharma General
Store. Chapters neeche description mein
hain — jo kaam chahiye, seedha wahan
jaaiye.

00:00:31.818 --> 00:00:38.955
Apna email aur password daal kar Log in
kijiye. Password hamesha dots mein chhupa
rehta hai.

00:00:43.407 --> 00:00:52.053
Ye dashboard hai. "To collect" batata hai
ki customers se kitna lena hai, aur "To
pay" ki suppliers ko kitna dena hai.

00:00:52.768 --> 00:01:00.842
Aaj ki sale, galle mein cash aur low stock
bhi yahin hai. Kisi bhi tile par click
kijiye — poori list khul jaati hai.

00:01:01.548 --> 00:01:08.764
Neeche Recent activity, sabse zyada udhaar
wale customers, aur khatam hota maal
dikhta hai.

00:01:09.497 --> 00:01:19.201
Baayein menu mein roz ke kaam, business,
reports aur settings hain. Upar search se
kisi bhi customer ya supplier tak turant
pahunchiye.

00:01:24.563 --> 00:01:34.017
Settings mein "Business profile" kholiye.
Dukaan ka naam, GSTIN, pata aur UPI yahan
ek hi baar bharna hota hai.

00:01:34.728 --> 00:01:40.118
Side mein "Bill header preview" dikhata
hai ki aapke bill ke upar kya chhapega.

00:01:40.852 --> 00:01:47.114
Branding mein apna logo aur rang chuniye —
bill aur customer page usi rang mein
dikhenge.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:02.470
Customers list mein har customer ka
balance dikhta hai. Upar ke chips se sirf
"Owes me" ya "I owe them" filter kijiye.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:10.520
Naya customer: "Add party" dabaiye, naam
Ramesh Traders aur mobile number likhiye,
phir Save party.

00:02:20.787 --> 00:02:28.067
Ramesh ji ₹1,200 ka ration udhaar le gaye.
"You gave" dabaiye, amount aur note
likhiye, Save.

00:02:33.689 --> 00:02:40.743
Unhone ₹500 diye, par jaldi mein hamne
₹5,000 likh diya. Aisi galti roz hoti hai.

00:02:42.914 --> 00:02:53.346
Entry ke teen dots se "Correct" chuniye,
sahi amount ₹500 aur wajah likhiye. Purani
entry mitti nahi — record ke liye kati hui
rehti hai.

00:02:59.265 --> 00:03:07.477
Result: balance sahi ₹700. "Show
corrections" on karne par poori history
dikhti hai — kisne, kab, kya badla.

00:03:12.929 --> 00:03:20.730
"Statement" kholiye. Passbook ki tarah har
entry aur running balance — isko print
kijiye ya customer ko bhejiye.

00:03:23.105 --> 00:03:33.390
"Send reminder" se ek polite message
taiyaar milta hai — naam, baaki rakam aur
dukaan ka naam ke saath. WhatsApp par
click, aur bhej dijiye.

00:03:34.091 --> 00:03:42.019
Reminders page par dikhta hai kiska paisa
aaj aana hai, kiska late ho gaya, aur
kisko reminder ja chuka hai.

00:03:42.738 --> 00:03:52.838
Aging report udhaar ko umar ke hisaab se
baantti hai. 90 din se purana paisa sabse
zyada risk mein hai — wahan pehle phone
kijiye.

00:03:58.282 --> 00:04:06.698
Items mein har cheez ka selling price, GST
aur dukaan mein bacha stock dikhta hai.
Upar poore stock ki value bhi.

00:04:07.417 --> 00:04:14.915
Basmati Rice kholiye. Stock, average cost,
aur har aana-jaana — opening, bikri,
kharid — ek list mein.

00:04:15.622 --> 00:04:24.393
Do bori bheeg kar kharab ho gayi? "Adjust
stock" mein reason Damage chuniye,
quantity minus 2, aur Post adjustment.

00:04:33.225 --> 00:04:43.691
Low stock report batata hai ki kya reorder
level se neeche hai — jaise Sugar. Stock
summary mein poore maal ki value average
cost par milti hai.

00:04:49.146 --> 00:04:57.402
Bills mein "New bill" dabaiye. Walk-in ke
liye seedha items, udhaar customer ke liye
"Party" chuniye — Ramesh Traders.

00:05:04.677 --> 00:05:14.389
Item mein "Basm" likhiye aur Basmati Rice
5kg chuniye, quantity 2. Rate aur GST item
se apne aap bhar jaate hain.

00:05:15.113 --> 00:05:19.781
"Add item" se doosri line — Toor Dal 1kg,
quantity 3.

00:05:24.535 --> 00:05:35.376
Totals dekhiye: taxable value, CGST aur
SGST alag-alag. Customer doosre state ka
hota, to IGST apne aap lagta.

00:05:36.119 --> 00:05:45.420
"Issue" dabaiye. Ramesh ji abhi ₹500
Google Pay se de rahe hain — amount aur
mode chuniye, phir "Received ₹500 ·
Issue".

00:05:53.436 --> 00:06:02.820
Bill taiyaar! Stock kam ho gaya, aur baaki
rakam Ramesh ji ke khata mein jud gayi.
Print A4 ya 80 mm thermal — dono hain.

00:06:03.521 --> 00:06:12.466
Bill par UPI QR chhapta hai — customer
scan karke turant pay kar sakta hai, aur
rakam shabdon mein bhi likhi hoti hai.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:22.638
"Share on WhatsApp" se bill ka link jaata
hai. Customer ko bina app ke aisa page
dikhta hai — sirf aapki dukaan ke naam ke
saath.

00:06:28.666 --> 00:06:36.357
Priya Sweets ne das kilo cheeni ka rate
poocha. "New estimate" banaiye, item
daaliye aur "Save & send".

00:06:52.960 --> 00:07:00.312
Customer maan gaya? Estimate par "Convert
to invoice" dabaiye — saari lines naye
bill mein aa jaati hain.

00:07:01.017 --> 00:07:08.123
Suresh ji ek Toor Dal wapas laaye. Unka
bill kholiye, "Return items" chuniye aur
quantity 1.

00:07:15.477 --> 00:07:22.544
Save karte hi credit note ban jaata hai:
Suresh ji ka balance kam, aur Toor Dal
wapas stock mein.

00:07:27.903 --> 00:07:33.525
Payments mein "Record payment" dabaiye.
Received chuniye aur customer — Suresh
Kumar.

00:07:41.361 --> 00:07:45.509
PhonePe chuniye, amount ₹1,000, aur Save
payment.

00:07:50.376 --> 00:08:00.937
Receipt number ban gaya. Pehle baaki bill
chukta hota hai; bachi rakam advance ban
kar rehti hai. Suresh ji ka khata bhi
update ho gaya.

00:08:06.334 --> 00:08:15.297
Sugar kam tha, to Gupta Wholesale se 50
packet aaye. Purchases mein "New bill",
supplier chuniye aur unka bill number
likhiye.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:29.899
Item — Sugar 1kg, quantity 50, cost ₹40,
GST se pehle.

00:08:33.901 --> 00:08:41.070
"Record" dabaiye. Stock mein 50 Sugar jud
gayi. Paisa abhi de diya, to bill wahin
"Paid" ho jaata hai.

00:08:42.751 --> 00:08:51.178
Pichhla bill abhi baaki hai? Purchases
mein "Unpaid" bill kholiye aur "Pay
supplier" se bank ya UPI payment likhiye.

00:09:07.136 --> 00:09:14.147
"Add expense" dabaiye: amount ₹250,
category, Cash, aur note — Delivery auto.
Save.

00:09:27.148 --> 00:09:35.918
Cashbook mein har din ka opening, aaya
paisa, gaya paisa aur closing. Cash aur
Bank-UPI alag bhi dekh sakte hain.

00:09:41.509 --> 00:09:48.155
Reports mein saari reports ek jagah hain —
paisa, customer-supplier, stock, aur
sales-GST.

00:09:48.892 --> 00:09:55.178
Day book mein din ka har bill, payment aur
kharcha samay ke kram se — cash aur bank
ke saath.

00:09:55.888 --> 00:10:06.818
Sales register mein har bill ka taxable
value, CGST, SGST aur IGST. B2B aur B2C ke
liye alag filter bhi hai.

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:18.400
GST summary mein rate ke hisaab se outward
aur inward tax, HSN summary, aur bill
series — GST return bharne ke liye
taiyaar.

00:10:19.107 --> 00:10:25.901
Har report par "Export" hai — CSV file
download karke seedha CA ko bhej dijiye.

00:10:31.248 --> 00:10:40.021
Purane customers Excel mein hain? Import
mein pehle template download kijiye, usme
naam, mobile aur baaki bhariye.

00:10:40.722 --> 00:10:51.730
Customers ke saamne "Choose" dabaiye aur
apni CSV file chuniye. YourKhata har line
check karta hai, aur galti wali line pehle
hi bata deta hai.

00:10:52.451 --> 00:11:00.653
Sab theek hai, to "Import 3 customers"
dabaiye. Teen naye customers unke purane
baaki ke saath list mein aa gaye.

00:11:06.073 --> 00:11:14.117
Team mein "Add member": naam Vikas, email,
aur role Staff. Staff bill bana sakta hai,
par settings nahi badal sakta.

00:11:20.068 --> 00:11:29.174
"Create login" — ek temporary password
sirf ek baar dikhta hai (video mein
chhupaya gaya hai). Ise WhatsApp se Vikas
ko bhejiye.

00:11:29.876 --> 00:11:34.756
Activity log mein har kaam — kisne, kab,
kya kiya — likha rehta hai.

00:11:35.463 --> 00:11:45.266
"Your data" se poora data ek ZIP mein
download kijiye. Support team bhi aapki
ijaazat ke bina aapka business nahi dekh
sakti.

00:11:50.687 --> 00:11:57.029
Upar account menu se Hindi chuniye — poora
app Hindi mein. Wapas English bhi yahin
se.

00:12:06.403 --> 00:12:13.481
To aapne dekha — udhaar, stock, GST bill,
payment, kharid, kharche aur reports, sab
ek hi jagah.

00:12:13.931 --> 00:12:22.677
Lending & collections, Library, Gym &
fitness aur Hotel & stays modules planned
hain — ye abhi app mein nahi hain.

00:12:23.127 --> 00:12:32.164
Video pasand aaya ho to share kijiye.
YourKhata ke saath apne business ka hisaab
aaj hi shuru kijiye. Dhanyavaad!
